@startuml
title Receiving Notifications
participant Domain_view participant PostgreSQL participant Channel_layer participant NotificationConsumer participant Notifications.jsx participant Recipient
Domain_view -> PostgreSQL : Persist Notification
Domain_view -> Channel_layer : on_commit notification.created
Channel_layer -> NotificationConsumer : Group notifications_<id>
NotificationConsumer -> Notifications.jsx : {"type":"notification",...}
Notifications.jsx -> Recipient : Prepend item; refresh count locally
Recipient -> Notifications.jsx : Mark read: DB/local only
@enduml
